WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:06.070
Francine, will you be mine?

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:24.170
That night, an alchemist vanished
from the streets of Prague.

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:26.920
And with him, a woman.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:29.630
Did the younger brother abduct her?

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.840
I embarked on a journey to find them.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:38.140
You know what happened next, don't you?

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:39.770
How does Minghai know?

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:54.160
Before dawn, when the stars paint the sky

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:58.950
I am searching for the thing I lost

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:03.710
With a restless heart
Under the sun yet in the dark

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:08.340
I patch together little prayers
to light my path

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:13.130
I don't need anything,
as my hands are full

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:18.010
My hands are full of emptiness

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:22.640
Please, just once, nod for me

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:27.610
Just once, reach out to me like the mirror

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:32.400
I will live for that single moment,
that single second

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:37.160
All the rest can just burn away

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:41.990
What's right for me is for me alone

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:46.830
Whatever the path, I'll follow it to you

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:51.630
This feeling grows and grows,
deep inside my heart

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:55.260
For one single reason

00:01:55.430 --> 00:02:03.220
I continue to climb up on the stage

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:15.150
9 years after they vanished from Prague.

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:17.570
It was springtime.

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:20.280
#10 Francine

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:24.290
Jin, Jin!

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:30.380
I'll kill you. You will feel my wrath!

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:32.460
Jin!

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:42.180
Oh? What's wrong, Yin?

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:45.100
You know what!

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:49.440
Ouch. What are you so mad about?

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:52.190
You stole Francine from me and ran away!

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.570
I searched for you for 9 whole years.

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:57.400
What are you talking about?

00:02:57.950 --> 00:03:00.240
Francine is my wife.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:09.620
Yin, my own big brother...

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:14.170
Why did you betray me?

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:18.470
I told you that Francine was mine.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:23.470
You said you didn't like her.
Yet, you...

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:28.390
You took Francine from me!

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:29.520
Jin.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:34.820
I was at the church that day.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:42.450
I came to my senses
upon hearing those words.

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:48.830
It's true that I betrayed your heart.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.210
That's fine, Yin.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:02.220
You're surprised. I surprised Yin!

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:06.310
I finally came to the realization,

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:11.310
that Jin was no longer the Jin I knew.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:16.730
Oh yeah, Yin.
I've kept up my research on alchemy.

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:22.700
My medicine is almost complete.
Soon I'll be able to cure Francine.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:26.330
Cure? Is she sick? Where is she?

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:29.700
Those accursed villagers...

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:41.760
Excuse me...

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:49.020
I know not who you are, but do not
come any closer. You must leave.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:53.520
And be sure to rinse your mouth
and wash your hands.

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:55.690
Francine.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:00.650
Can it be...?

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:03.360
Francine! It's me, Yin.

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:09.790
Yin.

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:11.700
Is this a vision?

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:16.630
Vision or not, don't disappear.

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:20.710
I'm no vision, I've finally found you
after 9 years.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:23.590
Finally...

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:30.510
I thank you, Lord.

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:34.480
You reunited me with
the one I love the most.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:38.060
Come closer, let me see your face.

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:44.320
Are you okay? Who did that?

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.700
Who locked you up and why?

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.280
Don't be angry.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:53.700
The villagers just want
to protect their families.

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:58.080
I'm sorry. I've fallen sick.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:01.710
I can't let you catch it. So...

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:05.010
So this is goodbye.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:07.550
Come closer.

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:11.680
If you breathe the air I breathe,
you could die too.

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:13.430
I mind not!

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:15.980
If I die embracing my wife, so be it!

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.100
Come to me, Francine.

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:20.560
Yes.

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:28.740
Listen to me. You are my wife.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:30.780
No matter what.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.290
Oh, Yin.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:38.120
Let me examine you. Take off your clothes.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:43.340
I learned Chinese and Western medicine
during my long journey.

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:45.130
I'm certain I can heal you.

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:48.630
Then we can live together at last.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:55.310
Did you meet Jin?

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.310
Yeah.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:02.520
Don't be too hard on him.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:09.360
During our journey here, and even now,

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:14.030
his soul has never been truly at ease.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:18.330
May I sit down?

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:23.420
Look at me.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:26.670
I can't even stay standing.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:31.050
I tried my best because you came,
but this is all I can do.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:33.550
She's weaker than I thought.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.720
What is this disease?

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:38.180
The door's open!

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:41.480
Who are you? You trespasser!

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:43.440
The villagers! Run!

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:46.530
Just you wait! I'm an alchemist.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:48.610
I'll find a cure for you.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:51.360
I'm sorry.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:55.490
But I can't live with you anymore.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:59.000
Don't give up! Once Aqua Vitae
is complete, I can cure you.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:05.420
I returned to Jin's mansion
and set to work.

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:07.960
I went days without sleep.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:11.930
I'd collapse with fatigue,
then awaken and continue.

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:13.930
Until finally...

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:24.230
I succeeded in creating the substance
all alchemists had sought.

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:27.860
The "soft stone" that produces Aqua Vitae.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:29.940
Francine!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.120
No... No...!

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:39.830
I'll save you!

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:43.250
I've completed the medicine!
It can cure anything.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:50.710
Please give that medicine
to those who need it more.

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:53.720
Hair?

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:55.720
Francine?

00:08:56.510 --> 00:09:00.520
For 9 years, I lived with Jin.

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:03.230
You understand what that means.

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:07.230
It's not your fault.
I don't mind it one bit.

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:10.730
I swore myself to you before God.

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:14.860
Yet, I was with Jin.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:19.740
Knowing all the while how heartbroken
you would be.

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:24.250
Those 9 years cannot be erased.

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:27.080
Don't say that, stop it.

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:30.460
Remember the carnival?

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:35.010
It was so much fun.

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:41.270
Yin, thank you for being in my life.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:44.810
Thank you for your words.

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:48.980
Thank you for making me laugh so much.

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:54.190
Thank you for loving me.

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:58.660
No, don't go!

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:02.950
Who knew it'd be so hard?

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:08.000
I know. Next time, I'm going to hate you.

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:11.340
I'll be insolent and cold.

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:14.300
I won't open my heart to you.

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:20.350
So please, let us meet again
in another time and place.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:33.230
What did you say?

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.530
Francine!

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:03.260
You made it, too?

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:08.690
Francine never loved me. Not once.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:13.400
You had everything I wanted.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.860
You had it all along.

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:19.320
You're wrong.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:23.580
Why do you think
she didn't run away from you?

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:32.380
She was devoted to you as well.

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:36.630
You just didn't notice.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:46.970
That day, we parted there at Quiberon.

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:49.270
We never crossed paths again.

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:51.440
What happened after that?

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:56.610
The elder brother, Yin, left the village.

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:59.190
But the younger, Jin, stayed behind.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:02.950
23 years passed.

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:06.290
A beautiful face.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:08.410
Luscious lips.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.750
A lithe body.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.960
Only her hair is real.

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:16.170
And for blood, some Aqua Vitae.

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:26.930
Master.

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:29.480
Oh, Francine.

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.440
Call me "dear."

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.440
Yes, dear.

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:39.030
Come, I have some clowns
to make you laugh.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:53.000
Why is it? Why won't she laugh?

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:56.250
Are they not funny enough?

00:12:58.300 --> 00:13:01.050
I'll show you something else.

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:05.430
Something funnier and even more raucous.

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:10.220
Here are the people who took laughter
away from you 23 years ago.

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:14.900
Those who took away your life.
They will become the clowns now.

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:23.110
Listen well.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.910
You are all now afflicted with
ZONAPHA syndrome.

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:31.540
You must make someone laugh
in order to escape the pain.

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:36.330
Should you wish to live,
you must make Francine laugh.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:41.090
I was among those who suffered.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:47.430
The clowns' tricks intensified
and they began killing the villagers.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:52.020
All to make Francine laugh.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:15.370
Well, well. Here's another one left.

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:17.580
No, not her...

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:21.210
I'll do it myself.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.710
Angelina!

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:26.720
Francine!

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:28.970
What...?

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.650
Is that what happened?

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:42.610
Good, you're back to your senses.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:46.740
But the real hell was yet to come.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.410
It gets worse?

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:53.450
The true horror of ZONAPHA syndrome
is that you can't die.

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:59.500
Even after the puppets were gone,
the villagers couldn't die.

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:08.340
One fall, 6 years later,

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:10.800
"he" came to our village.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:18.310
What happened?

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:21.310
I told him everything.

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:24.400
And he told me what he knew, too.

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:28.490
Why that man did what he did.

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:32.910
All this, just for that?

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:34.830
I won't ever forgive him.

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:37.660
You won't forgive him?

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.210
Then let me ask you.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:44.090
Do you choose to survive
and fight the puppets?

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:47.670
Or let the passage of time
wither your life away?

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:51.470
I want to get my revenge.

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:53.430
I see.

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:56.930
Then I shall take responsibility.

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:05.690
I made Aqua Vitae using the soft stone.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:13.620
This should be enough
to save the villagers.

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:16.910
-Oh, thank you.
-Do not thank me yet.

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:23.380
Come here again tomorrow. It will be
your turn to question the villagers.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:28.510
And allow only those who wish for revenge
to drink this water.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:33.340
But how can we get revenge
on those atrocious puppets?

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:35.970
Open that chest, and you shall see.

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:40.310
Now go. Your daughter is waiting.

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:43.730
And who might you be?

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.610
I was born in China.

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:52.990
But I like the name given to me
in a place called Japan.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:54.950
"Shirogane."

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:58.950
My name is Shirogane.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:06.590
This water can be preserved
by having a human soul melted in it.

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:11.130
I shall dissolve here
and control the villagers.

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:16.220
Then crush every automaton
that Jin created.

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:22.980
Francine, I've kept you waiting
for so long.

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:26.060
It must be lonely by yourself in hell.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:32.780
With such devilish deeds as I have done,
I will be joining you soon.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.780
Francine.

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:41.790
I loved you from the bottom of my heart.

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:46.120
The following day...

00:17:55.970 --> 00:18:01.520
The moment I drank the water
from the well, I was no longer myself.

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:06.020
Various ideas came flowing into my mind.

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:10.070
Alchemy and foreign languages.

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:14.690
The basic structures of automata,
their weak points,

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:20.160
and how to control the puppets
created to destroy them.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:24.200
But above all, a strong emotion.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:29.170
A deep malice towards automata.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:32.840
Crush them. Crush every automaton!

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:36.760
Return dirt to dirt and puppet to puppet!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:43.640
But I drank the Aqua Vitae, too.

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:45.100
I'm not under its control.

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:47.060
Guy once said,

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:50.400
it takes longer
for idiots to feel the effects.

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.320
-What the heck?
-Wait.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:55.610
I understand how Yin died,
but what about Jin?

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.110
Let me enlighten you.

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:00.870
Before I send you all to hell.

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:02.580
Who are you?

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:06.540
One of Les Quatre Pionniers,
the four oldest automata.

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:07.870
He's Pantalone.

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:09.880
Who knew you'd be here?

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.630
You're looking well, Lucille.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:17.720
The Creator's loathing
then turned to a different target.

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:21.390
It turned to, of all things,
Lady Francine.

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:25.890
I punished those evil villagers.

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:29.520
I did it because I thought
you would laugh for me.

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:34.190
But you didn't laugh.

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:39.740
Does this hurt?
Yes, I designed you to need to breathe.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:43.780
But you're still merely
a machine-like puppet.

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:45.700
A soulless toy.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:52.420
Goodbye, you thing that wasn't Francine.

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.590
Goodbye.

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:01.090
The Creator left the village.

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:04.140
But Lady Francine was still alive.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:07.600
With her own hands, she distilled
synthetic body fluids.

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:11.690
Then used them to give us,
Les Quatre Pionniers, the power of will.

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:13.480
Will?

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:17.940
We are searching for a way
to make Lady Francine laugh.

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.530
To do so, we must drink Aqua Vitae.

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:26.280
Then we will be able to understand
how Lady Francine thinks and feels.

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:31.210
That is our mission
as the Midnight Circus.

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:35.250
So you've come here
to drink this spring water.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:40.510
Yes, the Creator tossed
the soft stone into that spring.

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:45.850
I can't let you drink it,
you puppet dressed in rags.

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:48.520
Who are you?

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:53.980
Insulting the clothes Lady Francine
gave to me. I will not allow this!

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:03.570
I will bring an end to the sins
of my ancestors.

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:05.820
Master, don't do it!

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.870
The Aqua Vitae can cure you.

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:10.750
He's right. Please, father!

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:14.750
I have no need for a life full of lies.

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:20.260
-I won't let you!
-Father!

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:23.760
I can die without regrets.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:27.760
I lived a true and fulfilling life.

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:48.280
It felt like Master's last words were the
same as Francine's in that fiery blaze.

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:53.790
The long journey of Yin's memory
was finally concluded.

00:21:55.040 --> 00:22:00.460
That conclusion was also
a beginning to the end.

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:03.420
The end of the Midnight Circus.

00:22:14.520 --> 00:22:17.020
Fly up high, Marionette

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:19.230
Turn to ash, gracefully

00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:23.740
My only purpose in life was to fight

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:28.530
Why am I so angry
even I dump my humanity

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:34.870
Without you, I can't smile anymore

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:40.040
I assume that I am to be blamed

00:22:40.210 --> 00:22:44.460
Like a puppet that can't smile naturally

00:22:44.760 --> 00:22:49.840
I feel like someone is pulling my strings

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:53.520
What am I even living for?

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:57.810
I was hurt, and thought
that nobody would understand

00:22:57.980 --> 00:23:02.940
But you came along,
and took me in your arms

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:08.910
I felt my tangled arms and legs

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:11.570
become free

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:14.040
Fly up high, Marionette

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:16.370
I think now I can reach you

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:20.960
Before I met you, I was empty

00:23:21.130 --> 00:23:25.800
Now I have something
I'd give my all to protect

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:32.140
You taught me how to feel,
the feeling of sorrow too
